      "reason": "The empty-buffer branch returns (0, nil) when the destination length is zero and (0, io.EOF) when it is one. TestBufferEmptyReads asserts both results on a zero-value Buffer.",
      "line": 341,
      "fragment": "if len(p) == 0 {\n\t\t\treturn 0, nil\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn 0, io.EOF"
